---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArticleContent from '@/components/articles/ArticleContent.astro';
import ArticleFAQ from '@/components/articles/ArticleFAQ.astro';
import StatsBar from '@/components/articles/StatsBar.astro';
import ArticleContactForm from '@/components/articles/ArticleContactForm.astro';
import ArticleTestimonials from '@/components/articles/ArticleTestimonials.astro';

const faqItems = [
  { question: "What should I ask during an initial consultation with a personal injury lawyer?", answer: "During your initial consultation, ask about the attorney's experience with cases similar to yours, their track record of results, how they will communicate with you throughout the case, who will actually be handling your case day-to-day, and how their fee structure works. Most personal injury attorneys work on a contingency fee basis, meaning you pay nothing unless they recover compensation for you." },
  { question: "How important is an attorney's experience in personal injury cases?", answer: "Experience is critical when selecting a personal injury attorney. An attorney who has handled cases similar to yours will understand the legal and factual issues that may arise, know how to negotiate effectively with insurance companies, and be prepared to take your case to trial if necessary. At Logeman & Iafrate, our attorneys bring over 60 years of combined experience representing injured clients throughout Michigan." },
  { question: "Should I be concerned if a lawyer makes promises about my case outcome?", answer: "Yes. Be cautious of attorneys who make unrealistic promises or guarantee specific settlement amounts. While an experienced attorney can provide realistic expectations based on past case results and the specific facts of your situation, no ethical lawyer can guarantee a particular outcome. Look for attorneys who are honest and straightforward about what to expect." },
  { question: "Why does it matter who will actually handle my case?", answer: "Some law firms assign cases to inexperienced attorneys or refer cases to affiliated firms without your input. It's important to know that the attorney you meet with will be actively involved in managing your case from start to finish. At Logeman & Iafrate, our experienced partners personally handle cases and maintain direct communication with clients throughout the representation." },
  { question: "Do most personal injury law firms offer free consultations?", answer: "Yes, most reputable personal injury law firms, including Logeman & Iafrate, offer free initial consultations. This allows you to discuss your case, understand your legal options, and determine if the attorney is the right fit for you—all without any financial obligation. We also offer virtual consultations for your convenience." },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="How to Select a Personal Injury Lawyer in Michigan | Logeman & Iafrate" description="Learn what to look for when selecting a personal injury attorney in Michigan. Discover key factors like experience, communication, and past results. Free consultation available from our Ann Arbor law firm with over 45 years of experience.">
  <ArticleContent>
    <p>Selecting the right personal injury lawyer after your accident is the most important decision you will likely make when deciding to pursue a <a href="/motor-vehicle-accidents-overview/no-fault-claim-attorney-ann-arbor-mi/">personal injury claim</a>. You need to know how the law firm will be compensated, how experienced the attorney is, and how the attorney will communicate with you concerning the progress on your case.</p>

    <h2><strong>These Are All Important Questions to Help You Select the Right Personal Injury Lawyer in Michigan</strong></h2>
    <p>It is strongly recommended to meet with the prospective attorney in person or by Zoom. This face-to-face meeting will allow both of you the opportunity to get answers to important questions. When hiring a <a href="/about/">personal injury attorney</a>, you should consider the following:</p>

    <h3><strong>Experience</strong></h3>
    <p>An attorney who has previously handled your type of accident case will be able to provide useful insight into how best to proceed with your case. An attorney's experience in a particular area of personal injury law is critical to obtaining a positive outcome. An attorney who has handled similar cases will be better prepared to represent you in your lawsuit and address legal and factual issues that may arise during your case.</p>

    <h3><strong>Past Results</strong></h3>
    <p>When speaking with a lawyer you may hire after an accident, it's always recommended to ask about past results. Some lawyers will make promises that are not realistic. Be careful of lawyers who make outlandish promises. A lawyer should give realistic settlement expectations based on past case results.</p>

    <h3><strong>Communication During the Representation</strong></h3>
    <p>It is always wise to discuss how the communication will occur during the representation. Also, who will be handling the case from start to end. It is important that the attorney you hire is actively involved in managing your case. Some law firms will assign your case to an inexperienced attorney who may not be well suited for your case. Other law firms have the right under the Fee Agreement to refer your case to an affiliated law firm and you will have no control over who ends up representing your legal interests. Make sure that you know who will be representing your interests.</p>

    <h3><strong>Free Initial Consultation</strong></h3>
    <p>When an <a href="/motor-vehicle-accidents-overview/car-accident-attorney-ann-arbor-mi/">accident victim</a> or their family begins to evaluate possible attorneys, it is important to see whether the law firm offers free initial consultations. Most injury law firms do not charge for an initial consultation.</p>
    <p>After you've been injured in an accident, asking the right questions before selecting your personal injury attorney is a critical step of obtaining a positive result.</p>

    <h2><strong>Choose Experienced Michigan Personal Injury Attorneys</strong></h2>
    <p>If you have been injured, are an accident victim and are looking for an experienced personal injury attorney you can trust in Michigan, the attorneys at <a href="/about-us/">Logeman & Iafrate, P.C.</a> can help.</p>
    <p>Serving clients throughout Michigan for over 45 years, our Ann Arbor based <a href="/personal-injury-overview/">Personal Injury Law Firm</a> is committed to helping the injured recover full and fair compensation for their economic losses, pain, and suffering. Visit us online at <a href="/">logeman.com</a> today or call <strong>(734) 994-0200</strong> toll free, for a free consultation.</p>
  </ArticleContent>

  <ArticleFAQ items={faqItems} />

  <StatsBar />

  <ArticleContactForm />

  <ArticleTestimonials />
</BaseLayout>
